created_at":"2026-04-09T09:42:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T09:45:40Z","body":"Aw man, I wanted a slider for my hps :(\n\nI think adding a .0 is explicit enough to distinguish float from int in editor. We could also have color coded variable but I'm not sure everyone is going to appreciate that, color is less accessible than other things iirc\n\nWhat's even weirder for me is the fact that [the documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.html) make it seem like a slider should appear for an export_range with an int:\n\n<img width=\"822\" height=\"179\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e66d8315-9a6f-41d9-a670-65dbdda6fa95\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4213171334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]